e randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLuo Li has a deep passion for gardening, and he has some fame in the community because of this. Shao Qi is the organizer of community activities, and Zhi Hao is the person in charge of the community organization. One day, Shao Qi finds Zhi Hao and proposes to hold a garden party, and also suggests inviting Luo Li to introduce his gardening achievements. Zhi Hao hesitates a bit, but Shao Qi smiles at him and gives him a nod of affirmation. Later, after the party invitation goes out, Luo Li accepts the invitation.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Shao Qi suggest inviting Luo Li in the proposal?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Shao Qi hopes to become good friends with Luo Li by inviting him and improve her own gardening skills.\nB. Shao Qi hopes to let Zhi Hao publicly praise Luo Li's gardening skills.\nC. Shao Qi thinks that inviting Luo Li helps to increase the attractiveness and influence of the party.\nD. Shao Qi wants to test Luo Li to see if he is willing to share his gardening skills.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":9.11033792004466E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1d4d6006945d28009b6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367956818,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:32:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"566c55c83ea24ddd89c30725ffce43cd"}